WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.650
Even a hundred-dollar AI plan has limits. A weekly cap can arrive while the work is still there.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.400
PairWork connects people and their AI tools to specialists with a different strength. No shared accounts.

3
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:20.150
When your team has spare capacity, help someone else. Human approval earns work credits.

4
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.900
When your week gets crowded, spend those credits. Post a brief, review a specialist result, and approve.

5
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:33.650
No per-job stablecoin transfer. No wallet step on every request. Credits stay inside a non-cash work ledger.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.400
The proposed ten-dollar Pro tier adds specialist choice and priority. Could it deliver ten percent more useful work? That is untested.

7
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:47.150
One thousand Pro teams at ten dollars yields ten thousand dollars gross monthly revenue, before costs. Illustration, not traction.

8
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.900
Future work logs, ratings, speed, and experience could inform Solana credit and reputation rules. Devnet posting remains unconfirmed.
